00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:58.230
I'm so done!

00:06:58.490 --> 00:07:00.730
My whole life is over!

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:05.390
I don't even care what happens 
to the world anymore!

00:07:05.390 --> 00:07:06.940
This is a can of Campbell's <i>sucks</i>!

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:08.860
Wh-What's wrong?

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:10.500
Milady...

00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:13.240
Milady's being ice cold to me!

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:13.240
Your lady?!

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:19.470
I-I don't really follow yet, but if you're 
having trouble, we can talk about it.

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:21.390
I know, right?!

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:26.670
If I get started on her,
 it's gonna take a while. Is that cool?

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:28.510
Sure! Don't worry about it!

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:29.970
McThanks!

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:33.930
Mick... what now?

00:07:34.570 --> 00:07:37.530
It means "thank you." Did you not know that?

00:07:37.530 --> 00:07:39.610
N-No. Sorry...

00:07:39.610 --> 00:07:40.820
OMG...

00:07:40.820 --> 00:07:42.270
OMG?

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:45.600
Hey, this is Beckenbesides, but do you
 know what "Floridya later" means?

00:07:45.600 --> 00:07:48.530
Can we start with what "Beckenbesides" means?!

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:52.870
I dunno how I can talk about this 
stuff unless you know what I mean.

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:54.340
I'm sorry.

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:56.680
Oh well, then...

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:59.720
First, I'm gonna teach you how 
all the cool people talk!

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:04.260
All right, make sure to clean 
up for tomorrow, okay?

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:04.720
So do you, like, know any 
kind of slang at all?

00:08:04.260 --> 00:08:05.880
Okay.

00:08:06.100 --> 00:08:07.140
Now, then...

00:08:08.360 --> 00:08:09.660
Uh, I've heard "XL" before...

00:08:09.660 --> 00:08:11.320
What does "XL" mean?!

00:08:11.320 --> 00:08:12.490
That didn't take long.

00:08:11.320 --> 00:08:12.840
It's not slang?!

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:25.020
Did I say you could rest?

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:26.720
Two more laps. Get moving.

00:08:26.720 --> 00:08:27.770
R-Right!

00:08:27.770 --> 00:08:28.570
Bourbon...

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:29.300
Sir?

00:08:29.300 --> 00:08:32.130
The Satsukishou's 200 meters longer 
than the last race you ran.

00:08:32.130 --> 00:08:32.830
Yes, sir.

00:08:32.830 --> 00:08:34.870
Give me three more laps on the sloping track.

00:08:34.870 --> 00:08:36.780
As you wish, Master.

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:52.750
It's a bit more crowded than usual, isn't it?

00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:54.550
It makes me kind of nervous!

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:56.890
Okay, you want me to chase them off?

00:08:56.890 --> 00:08:59.200
Don't. Think of this as 
training to focus,

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:01.470
no matter what kind of 
distractions there are.

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:02.760
Are you going to be okay?

00:09:02.760 --> 00:09:06.640
I tend to do better when 
I'm being watched, anyway.

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:08.110
It won't be a problem.

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:10.650
One other thing—Teio and 
McQueen are going to be

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:12.680
running different training 
regimens from now on.

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:15.360
You two are competing at the Tennoushou.

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:18.230
Until that's over, you probably 
shouldn't be too friendly.

00:09:18.230 --> 00:09:21.610
You'll want to work on your weaknesses, 
and come up with a winning strategy.

00:09:22.130 --> 00:09:23.630
I understand.

00:09:23.630 --> 00:09:25.250
You're right.

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:28.250
Starting today, I'm not 
gonna talk to McQueen.

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:30.380
A good idea.

00:09:32.570 --> 00:09:35.760
I guess you have to! 
Since this is a serious competition!

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:37.910
So what's my training look like?

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:39.570
You're gonna need these, Teio.

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:42.640
Jogging shoes?

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:44.980
And these are for McQueen.

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:47.980
Heavy...

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:48.770
<b>Heavy</b>

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:51.270
<b>Strategy Meeting</b>

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:51.270
<b>S
h
i
n
e
 
